    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> ：开场介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a>：中端酒店 vs 国际酒店获取物业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>：中端酒店业主 vs 国际酒店业主加盟品牌选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>：国央企和民企在酒店投资决策流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>：中端酒店vs国际酒店资金如何解决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>：经济形势与酒店投资的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>：中端酒店vs国际酒店投资决策流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>：中端酒店vs国际酒店投资决策上有无互相借鉴的点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> - 结束： 后增长乏力时代，想投资一家赚钱的酒店，酒店老板在投资立项阶段应该注意什么 ？</span></p><span></span><p><span>大粒子微信号 ：yiyue4636</span></p><span></span><p><span>大粒子公众号：酒店资管交流岛</span></p>]]></description>
