    <title>2023年酒店业如何通过科学、合理的定价策略，打个翻身仗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643a816ea79cc8147094d9c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643a816ea79cc8147094d9c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Apr 2023 10:50:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>客房定价是酒店品牌与业主最激烈的冲突和矛盾。酒店如何在2023年经济下行周期，通过科学、合理的定价法，去客户、与业主、与竞争对手battle，让酒店2023年业绩打个翻身仗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期人物</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大粒子：</span></strong><span>国内某头部房产酒店研策负责人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>eason : </span></strong><span>14年国内外酒店工作经历+酒店投资人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline ：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 主流酒店定价方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a>:自动化酒店定价可行吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a>经过疫情对酒店定价的思考</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作/交流</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信：yiyue4636 / whq1256460845&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>电话：186 6430 7292 / 159 9961 3561&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微信公众号</span></strong><span>：酒店资管交流岛 /小王在酒店</span></p>]]></description>
